{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":70,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Au chef de musique. De David ; pour faire souvenir.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"Hâte-toi, ô Dieu, de me délivrer ! [hâte-toi], ô Éternel, de me secourir !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Que ceux qui cherchent ma vie soient honteux et confondus ; qu’ils se retirent en arrière et soient confus, ceux qui prennent plaisir à mon malheur ;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Qu’ils retournent en arrière à cause de leur honte, ceux qui disent : Ha ha ! ha ha !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Que tous ceux qui te cherchent s’égaient et se réjouissent en toi ; et que ceux qui aiment ton salut disent continuellement : Magnifié soit Dieu !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Et moi, je suis affligé et pauvre ; ô Dieu, hâte-toi vers moi ! Tu es mon secours et celui qui me délivre ; Éternel, ne tarde pas !","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/70.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/71.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/69.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}